(no output — byte-identical, 32 files)

Determinism note: the only random input is uuid4 delivery ids for
auto-dispatched alert webhooks; golden request bodies canonicalize them to
`<auto-deliveryId>` and re-sign with the fixed golden secret
(`signatureCanonicalized: true`), so the recorded bodySha256/signature are
reproducible. Explicit `dlv-golden-1` deliveries are recorded raw. Raw-wire
signature verification is exercised by tests (test_usage.py) and the manual
delivery golden.

